{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 261434, "name": "Alfredo Suarez", "username": "alfredo2", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.auth0.com/alfredo2/{size}/44270_2.png", "created_at": "2023-02-14T13:39:19.489Z", "cooked": "<p>Hello Auth0 friends,</p>\n<p>We have automated basically everything that has to do with setting up a connection and an application, however, I am still having trouble setting the parameters of the IdP Initiated SSO to Accept Requests and fill the necessary parameters via API.</p>\n<p>Can you maybe point me in the right direction? What kind of API do I need to use to set this up. It\u2019s the last piece in my puzzle, I appreciate your help.</p>", "post_number": 1, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 3, "updated_at": "2023-02-14T13:39:19.489Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 39, "reads": 14, "readers_count": 13, "score": 197.8, "yours": false, "topic_id": 100455, "topic_slug": "enterprise-saml-connection-idp-initiated-sso-via-api", "display_username": "Alfredo Suarez", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 45781, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": false, "wiki": false, "post_url": "/t/enterprise-saml-connection-idp-initiated-sso-via-api/100455/1", "user_signature": null, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true, "can_vote": false}, {"id": 471116, "name": "Vijay Tangudu", "username": "vtangudu", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.auth0.com/vtangudu/{size}/74675_2.png", "created_at": "2026-03-06T20:58:57.925Z", "cooked": "<p>Is it doable? I tried using below on a \u201cUpdate Connection\u201d API but no luck -</p>\n<p>{<br>\n\u201coptions\u201d: {<br>\n\u201cidp_initiated\u201d: {<br>\n\u201csso_enabled\u201d: true,<br>\n\u201cdefault_app\u201d: \u201c{client_id}\u201d,<br>\n\u201cresponse_protocol\u201d: \u201copenid-connect\u201d<br>\n// Optional: You can also include a specific query string configuration if needed<br>\n// \u201cquery_string\u201d: \u201credirect_uri=https%3A%2F%<a href=\"http://2Fyour-app-callback-url.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">2Fyour-app-callback-url.com</a>%2F%3Fconnection%3Dyour-connection-name\u201d<br>\n}<br>\n}<br>\n}</p>\n<p>Can someone provide a solution or point me to the documentation if any.</p>", "post_number": 2, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 3, "updated_at": "2026-03-06T20:58:57.925Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 5, "readers_count": 4, "score": 1.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 100455, "topic_slug": "enterprise-saml-connection-idp-initiated-sso-via-api", "display_username": "Vijay Tangudu", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "http://2Fyour-app-callback-url.com", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "clicks": 0}], "read": true, "user_title": null, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 84891, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": false, "wiki": false, "post_url": "/t/enterprise-saml-connection-idp-initiated-sso-via-api/100455/2", "user_signature": null, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 471440, "name": "Nikita Baleca", "username": "nik.baleca", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/community.auth0.com/nik.baleca/{size}/68749_2.png", "created_at": "2026-03-11T22:19:54.546Z", "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/vtangudu\">@vtangudu</a></p>\n<p>This should be possible via the Management API using this example payload:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">{\n\"options\": {\n\"signInEndpoint\": \"yourIdpSignInUrl\",\n\"idpinitiated\": {\n\"client_id\": \"yourClientId\",\n\"client_protocol\": \"saml\",\n\"client_authorizequery\": \"\"\n},\n\"signingCert\": \"[copied-from-GET]\"\n}\n</code></pre>\n<p>This is mentioned in our documentation <a href=\"https://auth0.com/docs/authenticate/protocols/saml/saml-sso-integrations/identity-provider-initiated-single-sign-on#application-drop-down-list-limited-to-100\">here</a>.</p>\n<p>If you have any other questions, let me know!</p>\n<p>Kind Regards,<br>\nNik</p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 3, "updated_at": "2026-03-11T22:19:54.546Z", "reply_count": 0, "reply_to_post_number": null, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 5, "readers_count": 4, "score": 16.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 100455, "topic_slug": "enterprise-saml-connection-idp-initiated-sso-via-api", "display_username": "Nikita Baleca", "primary_group_name": "DeveloperHubMembers", "flair_name": "DeveloperHubMembers", "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": "", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 75, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "link_counts": [{"url": "https://auth0.com/docs/authenticate/protocols/saml/saml-sso-integrations/identity-provider-initiated-single-sign-on#application-drop-down-list-limited-to-100", "internal": false, "reflection": false, "title": "Configure SAML Identity Provider-Initiated Single Sign-On - Auth0 Docs", "clicks": 3}], "read": true, "user_title": "Auth0 Community Engineer", "title_is_group": false, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [{"id": 2, "count": 1}], "moderator": true, "admin": true, "staff": true, "user_id": 76022, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": false, "wiki": false, "user_custom_fields": {"signature_cooked": "<p>If this post helped you, click the check mark <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> or give it a Like <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/+1.png?v=15\" title=\":+1:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">. When you do this, you\u2019re helping an entire community of developers just like you.</p>"}, "post_url": "/t/enterprise-saml-connection-idp-initiated-sso-via-api/100455/4", "user_signature": "<p>If this post helped you, click the check mark <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> or give it a Like <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/+1.png?v=15\" title=\":+1:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\">. When you do this, you\u2019re helping an entire community of developers just like you.</p>", "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": true, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 472239, "name": "system", "username": "system", "avatar_template": "https://global.discourse-cdn.com/auth0/original/3X/b/5/b560f266932fcce5d57f09a6595bd50518cae3f3.jpeg", "created_at": "2026-03-25T22:20:50.039Z", "cooked": "<p>This topic was automatically closed 14 days after the last reply. New replies